  "details": "There is an issue with putting animations in the base layer that causes the preview to be shown at world origin instead of inside the menu. This normally goes away if you close your menu but with the new UI they now stay in the world over rendering everything, and it appears that they might stack each time you open the menu, as when I open my menu avatar does a jump animation and you can see them in the provided screenshot clipping inside another copy of themselves.",
